(c) THE CAUSTIC MECHANISM (statement, cited):
    A pressureless self-gravitating dust sphere reaches a density
    singularity in finite time (t_coll, derived exactly above): all
    shells arrive at the centre on the same clock, rho -> infinity,
    mass conserved -- a CAUSTIC of the dark dust. Classical: Newtonian
    dust collapse (Lemaitre 1927; the GR analogue is Oppenheimer-Snyder
    1939; the caustic formation in pressureless collisionless matter
    is the textbook result (e.g. the Zel'dovich-Shandarin pancake
    mechanism; cited as such). The phantom's equilibrium cusp (D1)
    is the STATIC face of the same sector: its DYNAMICS collapse to a
    finite-time singularity on the Jeans scale -- the framework's
    singular sector is the DARK dust, not the baryon fluid.

PART D3 -- THE TRANSFER: the door's kill analysis
