(b) THE BOUNDED-PERTURBATION READ (statement):
    A force density bounded by a0/2 EVERYWHERE is N02's
    sub-regularizing class (the a0/2-capped drag, certified counts):
    it cannot close the enstrophy gap, and it cannot deliver an
    unbounded lever to the baryon material acceleration.  The caustic
    is therefore CONFINED to the dark sector: the phantom dust can
    pile up at its own centre in finite time, but its reaction on the
    baryon fluid is a uniformly bounded (L^inf <= a0/2) forcing.
    KILL K-1 FIRES: the transfer dies by measurement.

